N('Aynı anlamdaki cümle hangisi? → The book which was written by Orwell is famous.','The book written by Orwell is famous.','which was + V3 → V3 (pasif ilgi cümlesi kısaltılır).',{'The book writing by Orwell is famous.':'Pasif anlam için V3 (written) gerekir; writing aktiftir.','The book which written by Orwell is famous.':'which varsa çekimli fiil (was written) gerekir.'}),
